 ],
 "notes": "'Terraform-generated creation token' is checked as no literal creation_token in the plan (omitted, or unknown because a random_*/generated value feeds it). 'Default AWS-managed key': the declared file system omits kms_key_id, uses the aws/elasticfilesystem alias, or passes a variable; planned kms_key_id cannot be used because a CMK reference plans as null. Residual gap: a variable whose default is a CMK ARN passes. 'No lifecycle transitions' is checked as an empty planned lifecycle_policy. 'No mount targets / security group / file system policy by default' is checked as exactly one resource across the file system, mount target, security group and file system policy types (the file system itself), since exists cannot assert a zero count directly."
}
